<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Cloud Pro (from $80/month)</h3>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 my-4 space-y-1">
<li>$0.04/GB-mo storage (33% cheaper than Standard)</li>
<li>1000 IOPS + NVMe storage</li>
<li>GPU-accelerated indexing (2026 GA, H100/A100)</li>
<li>99.9% SLA + 24x5 ticket support</li>
<li>RBAC + SSO/SAML</li>
<li>HIPAA-ready (BAA optional)</li>
