<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Dedicated Contract (from $2,500+/month)</h3>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 my-4 space-y-1">
<li>Single-tenant node, no noisy neighbors</li>
<li>PrivateLink + Customer-managed KMS</li>
<li>99.95% SLA + 24x7 priority support</li>
